":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":11,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"I made the code change, but the acceptance command can't run, so this isn't proven yet. It fails the same way PKT-0080's did, which got that packet blocked. I haven't built or profiled the change.\n\n**Acceptance result:** `node .theseus/oracle/perf/profile-fonts.js <samples-dir> external/sdkjs 3` exits 1 with `samples-dir: No such file or directory`. Two problems:\n- The shell reads the literal `<samples-dir>` as an input redirect, so node never starts.\n- `profile-fonts.js` isn't on this branch; it only exists on `pkt/PKT-0072`.\n\nPKT-0083, already pending, fixes both. I didn't spawn a new request. This packet should depend on PKT-0083 and be rerun after it.\n\n**What changed:** I applied the existing source patch `.theseus/diagnosis/PKT-0077-sdkjs-shape-cache.patch` to `external/sdkjs/cell/view/StringRender.js`, the only target file.\n- `FragmentShaper.shapeFragment` now keeps a cache of up to 200k entries. The key is font name, size, bold/italic, screen resolution (PPI) and the characters.\n- On a cache hit it writes back the same glyph, width and character for each position that the normal shaping path writes. So cells whose text and font didn't change are no longer re-shaped.\n- Widths, wrapping and bidi should be identical, because the cached values are exactly what the normal path produced. I only checked that the file parses. I didn't rebuild sdkjs or run the existing tests, so the \"tests keep passing\" part of the contract is unchecked.\n\n**Where it is committed:**\n- **sdkjs change:** commit `f11c1d1` on a new branch `pkt/PKT-0081` in the `external/sdkjs` clone. `external/` isn't tracked by this repository, so the change exists only in that clone until someone pushes it to the sdkjs fork.\n- **This repository:** I committed the Executor log, the Lessons entry and the friction line. My first friction line had the wrong shape and `theseus validate` rejected it; I fixed it, and validate now shows 0 errors and 1 warning (pilot mode is on).\n\n**Lessons for the Atlas:**\n- Shaping cost on xlsx remote apply comes from how many times `shapeFragment` is called, and a cache in `StringRender` removes the repeat calls.\n- Placeholders like `<samples-dir>` in acceptance commands must be replaced with real paths before a packet is queued.","ttft_ms":2244,"type":"result","duration_ms":46649,"uuid":"3efa7009-1cb5-4bfd-b2a8-87ae1618db5f","ttft_stream_ms":1184,"time_to_request_ms":238,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":4,"system_prompt":119,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":3,"input_attachments":18,"input_hooks":2,"conversation_append":0,"transcript_persist":6,"tool_pool_refresh":1,"init_message":5,"init_frame_send":5,"engine_pickup":6,"loop_entry":3,"message_prep":1,"model_config_wait":0,"autocompact":2,"request_announcements":10,"query_setup":7,"auto_mode_context_wait":13,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":24,"message_normalization":1,"client_creation":2,"request_build":6},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":85,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":138,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":215,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":141,"process_rss_mib_result":230,"process_anon_mib_result":139,"process_peak_rss_mib":252,"process_cpu_ms_turn":2157,"process_wall_ms_turn":46649,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":924,"process_wall_ms_streaming":30194,"main_stream_count":11,"main_stream_event_count":685,"main_stream_chunk_count":365,"input_attachments_detail":{"slowest_producer":"artifact_opening_prefetch","slowest_producer_ms":7,"cpu_ms":18,"major_faults":0,"setup_ms":0,"prompt_producers_ms":0,"ambient_start_ms":7,"ambient_wait_ms":7,"render_ms":1,"producers":41,"token_counts":0},"first_content_frame_ms":1184,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":2640621,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"flag_fetch_kick":"started_in_init_warm","time_origin_ms":1793661336156.3076,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"proc